<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS7" title="In 7 Appendix ‣ SocialNav-SUB: Benchmarking VLMs for Scene Understanding in Social Robot Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.7 </span>Survey Question Details</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS8" title="In 7 Appendix ‣ SocialNav-SUB: Benchmarking VLMs for Scene Understanding in Social Robot Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.8 </span>Main Experiment Question Results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS9" title="In 7 Appendix ‣ SocialNav-SUB: Benchmarking VLMs for Scene Understanding in Social Robot Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.9 </span>Ablation Experiments</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS10" title="In 7 Appendix ‣ SocialNav-SUB: Benchmarking VLMs for Scene Understanding in Social Robot Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.10 </span>Rule-Based Baseline Details</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
