<span id="S7.T6.6.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.T6.6.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Goal End Position</span>: The end position of the goal with respect to the robot’s view.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S7.T6.6.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
